{"unit_id":"NattoCB__dsh-plugin-notifications#feature-1","repo":"NattoCB/dsh-plugin-notifications","commit":"b19696036b2402d71ab87d673714595914b95eb2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Notifications 的功能「根会话完成通知」：监听根会话从运行到空闲的状态变化，并在对话轮次结束时由 macOS 主机显示会话标题和最新助手回复。 触发方式为对话状态变化或在设置卡片中操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:215-227"]}
{"unit_id":"NattoCB__dsh-plugin-notifications#feature-2","repo":"NattoCB/dsh-plugin-notifications","commit":"b19696036b2402d71ab87d673714595914b95eb2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Notifications 的功能「合成提示音」：通知可附带柔和、清脆或低沉的合成提示音；音频在主机端生成 WAV，再由 terminal-notifier 播放。 触发方式为对话状态变化或在设置卡片中操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:56-61"]}
{"unit_id":"NattoCB__dsh-plugin-notifications#feature-3","repo":"NattoCB/dsh-plugin-notifications","commit":"b19696036b2402d71ab87d673714595914b95eb2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Notifications 的功能「通用设置卡片」：在 DSH 设置的通用项目中提供通知启用、提示音开关、音色选择和试听控件。 触发方式为对话状态变化或在设置卡片中操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:206-249"]}
{"unit_id":"NattoCB__dsh-plugin-notifications#feature-4","repo":"NattoCB/dsh-plugin-notifications","commit":"b19696036b2402d71ab87d673714595914b95eb2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Notifications 的功能「配置同步与客户端降级」：设置通过插件 HTTP 路由写入主机设置；主机接口不可用时客户端保留 localStorage 配置并自行监测会话。 触发方式为对话状态变化或在设置卡片中操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:233-239"]}
{"unit_id":"NattoCB__dsh-plugin-notifications#caveat-1","repo":"NattoCB/dsh-plugin-notifications","commit":"b19696036b2402d71ab87d673714595914b95eb2","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Notifications 的主机系统通知需要 macOS 和已安装于 /opt/homebrew/bin/terminal-notifier 的程序；其他平台不会触发主机通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:49-52","src/index.js:255-269"]}
